SPDX-FileNotice: retrods local patch, not part of upstream fmsx-libretro.

Do not clobber INLINE.

MSX.h and Z80.c do `#undef INLINE` and redefine it as `static inline`.
libretro-common's headers (compat/strl.h and friends) also write `static INLINE`,
which then becomes `static static inline` and fails to compile. Guarding the
redefinition lets the build system supply INLINE instead (see
cores/fmsx.extra.mk, which passes -DINLINE=__inline__ -fgnu89-inline).

Applied with: patch -p1 < patches/fmsx-libretro/0001-inline-not-clobbered.patch
